<title>UK: Grupo Bipop sets 200 billion lire convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Grupo Bipop sets 200 billion lire convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated convertible bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GRUPO BIPOP (BANCA POPOLARE DI BRESCIA )</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN LIRE  COUPON    *6.75-7.25 MATURITY    01.JAN.03</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC   1.50</p>
<p> NOTES     *FINAL PRICING DUE LATER.</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PREMIUM INDICATED AT 8-10 PCT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
